  "atomic_questions": [
    "At the end of December, does the remaining inventory have any value (for example, it is carried over and counted at some value), or is it simply leftover with no value, so the objective is purely the net revenue from the six months of buying and selling?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks a single clarification question regarding the valuation of remaining inventory at the end of the period."
}

