    "When you say \"maximize total revenue,\" do you mean net revenue (total sales revenue minus total purchase costs), or gross sales revenue only (ignoring the cost of purchases)?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single policy choice between two definitions of revenue, which constitutes one semantically independent question."
}

